Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.33,0:00:16.17,Main,,0,0,0,,This looks very old.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.17,0:00:17.71,Main,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.71,0:00:19.25,Main,,0,0,0,,Dunno.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.25,0:00:22.79,Main,,0,0,0,,Apparently, we confiscated it\Nas part of some case a long time ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.79,0:00:24.54,Main,,0,0,0,,I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.54,0:00:27.13,Main,,0,0,0,,So, what do you want me to do with it?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.42,0:00:31.92,Main,,0,0,0,,If you head west and cross the ocean,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.92,0:00:35.75,Main,,0,0,0,,there's a place called Qunorts,\Nthe Town of Freedom.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.75,0:00:38.46,Main,,0,0,0,,This job is to deliver this box
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.46,0:00:41.21,Main,,0,0,0,,to the United Magic Association\Nbranch office there.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.21,0:00:42.33,Main,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.33,0:00:45.04,Main,,0,0,0,,You just have to deliver it and get paid.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.04,0:00:46.38,Main,,0,0,0,,Easy, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.38,0:00:48.96,Main,,0,0,0,,What, that's it?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.96,0:00:52.96,Main,,0,0,0,,Why don't you want to do\Nsuch an easy job yourself, Teach?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.96,0:00:55.42,Main,,0,0,0,,Because I'm going on vacation.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.42,0:00:56.88,Main,,0,0,0,,Vacation?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.88,0:00:59.54,Main,,0,0,0,,I've been working too much. I'm tired.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.54,0:01:02.08,Main,,0,0,0,,I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.08,0:01:05.50,Main,,0,0,0,,Just make sure you don't open the box.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.50,0:01:07.96,Main,,0,0,0,,Something dangerous might be inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.96,0:01:09.21,Main,,0,0,0,,Aye-aye, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.21,0:01:11.33,Main,,0,0,0,,I will make sure not to open it!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.33,0:01:15.04,Main,,0,0,0,,Well, I'm off, then!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.67,0:01:21.46,Main,,0,0,0,,Well then, I guess I should go, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.67,0:02:58.00,MainTop,,0,0,0,,"The Two Teachers"
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.88,0:03:02.71,Main,,0,0,0,,You're working at a stuffy place, as usual.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.71,0:03:05.21,Main,,0,0,0,,It's been a year already, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.21,0:03:07.38,Main,,0,0,0,,Time and tide wait for no one.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.38,0:03:10.04,Main,,0,0,0,,Time flies, doesn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.04,0:03:12.42,Main,,0,0,0,,You an old lady or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.42,0:03:14.92,Main,,0,0,0,,Well? Are you ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.92,0:03:17.79,Main,,0,0,0,,Probably not, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.79,0:03:19.71,Main,,0,0,0,,Please wait one moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.71,0:03:21.17,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll be ready soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.88,0:03:28.79,Main,,0,0,0,,Miss Fran, do you have\Nurgent business somewhere?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.79,0:03:31.83,Main,,0,0,0,,No, I'm going on vacation.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.83,0:03:33.25,Main,,0,0,0,,Vacation?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.25,0:03:34.46,Main,,0,0,0,,Goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.21,0:03:45.04,Main,,0,0,0,,Kids, make sure you practice your magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.83,0:03:53.50,Main,,0,0,0,,What? You took on an apprentice?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.50,0:03:55.33,Main,,0,0,0,,Her name's Saya.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.33,0:03:57.83,Main,,0,0,0,,Apparently, she knows your apprentice.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.83,0:04:00.00,Main,,0,0,0,,Saya...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.00,0:04:04.75,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, the girl Elaina helped\Nbecome an apprentice witch.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.75,0:04:06.88,Main,,0,0,0,,It's a small world, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.92,0:04:10.75,Main,,0,0,0,,Definitely.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.75,0:04:12.38,Main,,0,0,0,,I met Elaina, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.38,0:04:13.92,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, my.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.92,0:04:18.88,Main,,0,0,0,,When I told Saya, she was\Nso frustrated, she wanted to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.92,0:04:24.04,Main,,0,0,0,,At any rate, it's strange, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.04,0:04:25.17,Main,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.17,0:04:30.42,Main,,0,0,0,,I never thought you and I would end up\Nvacationing together every year like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.42,0:04:34.08,Main,,0,0,0,,Right? I didn't like you at first, Fran.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.08,0:04:36.79,Main,,0,0,0,,And I didn't like you, Sheila.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.00,0:04:44.46,Main,,0,0,0,,This is the story
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.46,0:04:48.46,Main,,0,0,0,,of when I was still an apprentice\Nwitch traveling with my teacher.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.46,0:04:53.38,Main,,0,0,0,,Huh? What did you just say, ma'am?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.38,0:04:57.00,Main,,0,0,0,,I think I'm going to take on an apprentice.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.00,0:05:00.50,Main,,0,0,0,,Um, am I not an apprentice?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.50,0:05:03.13,Main,,0,0,0,,I was thinking I'd like another one.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.29,0:05:08.21,Main,,0,0,0,,I think that should be your decision.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.21,0:05:13.00,Main,,0,0,0,,But if I decide without asking you,\Nyou'll get mad, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.00,0:05:17.25,Main,,0,0,0,,You already have someone in mind\Nfor your other apprentice, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.25,0:05:18.71,Main,,0,0,0,,Bingo.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.71,0:05:20.67,Main,,0,0,0,,I knew it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.67,0:05:22.29,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, Fran.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.29,0:05:24.13,Main,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.13,0:05:28.21,Main,,0,0,0,,She's a good girl,\Nso I'm sure you'll like her, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.96,0:05:37.04,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.04,0:05:41.00,Main,,0,0,0,,You're late, Teach!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.00,0:05:44.29,Main,,0,0,0,,You've got guts to make me wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.29,0:05:46.79,Main,,0,0,0,,Sorry about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.79,0:05:50.17,Main,,0,0,0,,It took some time to convince my apprentice.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.17,0:05:53.42,Main,,0,0,0,,Will you please refrain\Nfrom telling lies so casually?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.67,0:05:57.21,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.21,0:06:00.17,Main,,0,0,0,,So she's my senior apprentice?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.17,0:06:03.25,Main,,0,0,0,,She looks really weak.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.25,0:06:05.67,Main,,0,0,0,,Huh? Whaddaya want?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.67,0:06:09.75,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't stare at me. You wanna fight?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.75,0:06:12.71,Main,,0,0,0,,Ma'am, just what part of her is a "good girl"?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.71,0:06:16.21,Main,,0,0,0,,She's been glaring at me and spewing\Ninsults since the moment we met.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.21,0:06:18.38,Main,,0,0,0,,What'd you say?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.63,0:06:24.13,Main,,0,0,0,,Now, now, you're fellow apprentices,\Nso you need to get along.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.67,0:06:28.67,Main,,0,0,0,,Very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.42,0:06:32.38,Main,,0,0,0,,Nice to meet you. What's your name?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.38,0:06:34.63,Main,,0,0,0,,I have no name I want to give {\i1}you{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.96,0:06:43.13,Main,,0,0,0,,This is Fran. And this is Sheila.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.13,0:06:45.13,Main,,0,0,0,,Be nice to each other from now on.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.79,0:06:53.96,Main,,0,0,0,,Ma'am, I don't think that's possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.08,0:07:06.67,Main,,0,0,0,,And so, my teacher and I began\Nour journey together with Sheila.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.67,0:07:10.38,Main,,0,0,0,,The two of us were like oil and vinegar.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.96,0:07:16.71,Main,,0,0,0,,What shall we have for dinner?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.71,0:07:19.13,Main,,0,0,0,,Fish? Or Beef?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.13,0:07:20.96,Main,,0,0,0,,I'd like fish.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.96,0:07:23.50,Main,,0,0,0,,I want meat.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.50,0:07:25.88,Main,,0,0,0,,Huh? You wanna fight?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.88,0:07:28.08,Main,,0,0,0,,Is that all you know how to say?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.08,0:07:31.17,Main,,0,0,0,,Are you stupid? Are you an idiot?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.17,0:07:33.83,Main,,0,0,0,,Is that all {\i1}you {\i0}can say?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.83,0:07:37.71,Main,,0,0,0,,You've got a puny vocabulary.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.71,0:07:40.71,Main,,0,0,0,,Then, let's meet in the middle and have bread.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.71,0:07:41.88,Main,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.92,0:07:47.42,Main,,0,0,0,,Fire magic and ice magic.\NWhich shall I teach you today?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.42,0:07:48.83,Main,,0,0,0,,I'd like to learn about ice magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.83,0:07:52.21,Main,,0,0,0,,Huh? It should be fire. Stop messing around!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.21,0:07:56.17,Main,,0,0,0,,Then, let's meet in the middle\Nand take a break today.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.96,0:08:09.21,Main,,0,0,0,,If your wand gets taken away,\Nhow would you fight?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.21,0:08:12.08,Main,,0,0,0,,With martial arts! Teach us some martial arts!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.08,0:08:14.50,Main,,0,0,0,,Please teach us how to use a bow.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.50,0:08:16.46,Main,,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.46,0:08:20.88,Main,,0,0,0,,Then, let's meet in the middle.\NI'll teach you how to use knives.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.88,0:08:23.00,Main,,0,0,0,,Knives?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.00,0:08:25.29,Main,,0,0,0,,This is how you hide them.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.38,0:08:28.17,Main,,0,0,0,,When you draw them, do it...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.04,0:08:33.04,Main,,0,0,0,,...like this,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.04,0:08:35.38,Main,,0,0,0,,in a sexy way.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.00,0:08:45.29,Main,,0,0,0,,You're the only person I don't think\NI could ever become friends with.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.29,0:08:47.21,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, my, what a coincidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.21,0:08:51.08,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You're {\i0}the only person I don't think {\i1}I{\i0}\Ncould ever become friends with.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.75,0:08:56.42,Main,,0,0,0,,During our travels over many months,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.42,0:09:00.79,Main,,0,0,0,,we took on a job from United Magic Association
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.79,0:09:03.96,Main,,0,0,0,,in Qunorts, the Town of Freedom.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.13,0:09:08.17,Main,,0,0,0,,"No mages!"
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.17,0:09:10.96,Main,,0,0,0,,"Don't fear mages!"
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.96,0:09:14.00,Main,,0,0,0,,"Mages are children of the devil."
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.00,0:09:17.21,Main,,0,0,0,,What the heck? Are they picking a fight with us?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.21,0:09:22.04,Main,,0,0,0,,It appears magic users like us\Nare not welcome in this country.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.04,0:09:24.83,Main,,0,0,0,,I wonder.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.83,0:09:26.88,Main,,0,0,0,,Just because something like this exists here
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.88,0:09:31.00,Main,,0,0,0,,doesn't mean we should\Nreject the entire country.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.00,0:09:36.21,Main,,0,0,0,,If we do, then we'd be the same as those\Nputting up these posters and signs.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.63,0:09:45.38,Main,,0,0,0,,Welcome! We have been waiting for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.38,0:09:48.67,Main,,0,0,0,,Madam Witch, to cut to the chase, the job is--
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.67,0:09:50.63,Main,,0,0,0,,How much does it pay?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.92,0:09:56.96,Main,,0,0,0,,I was going to tell you\Nwhat the job was first...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.96,0:09:58.38,Main,,0,0,0,,How much?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.38,0:10:02.17,Main,,0,0,0,,Um... ten gold coins.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.63,0:10:06.83,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, she looks really happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.83,0:10:09.21,Main,,0,0,0,,And? What's the job?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.21,0:10:13.00,Main,,0,0,0,,Right, working behind the scenes in this town
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.00,0:10:17.04,Main,,0,0,0,,is a suspicious group calling\Nthemselves the Curio Company.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.04,0:10:19.29,Main,,0,0,0,,I see. The Curio Company.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.29,0:10:26.42,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm sure you've seen the posters and\Nsigns around town defaming mages...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.42,0:10:27.38,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.38,0:10:29.33,Main,,0,0,0,,Those, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.33,0:10:32.08,Main,,0,0,0,,The Curio Company is a band of robbers
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.08,0:10:34.29,Main,,0,0,0,,made up of people who can't use magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.29,0:10:36.33,Main,,0,0,0,,Since they can't use magic,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.33,0:10:41.17,Main,,0,0,0,,they can't stand the mages\Nwho can get in their way,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.17,0:10:45.42,Main,,0,0,0,,so they harass and defame mages.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.50,0:10:51.46,Main,,0,0,0,,Why don't you guys just catch them?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.46,0:10:54.58,Main,,0,0,0,,You're mages, right?\NIt should be a piece of cake.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.58,0:10:57.25,Main,,0,0,0,,Is it really necessary to pay\Na large sum to travelers
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.25,0:11:00.83,Main,,0,0,0,,to resolve the situation?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.83,0:11:03.21,Main,,0,0,0,,You're absolutely right, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.46,0:11:06.83,Main,,0,0,0,,You have other reasons, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.83,0:11:07.83,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.83,0:11:11.63,Main,,0,0,0,,The Curio Company has some mysterious tools.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.63,0:11:13.29,Main,,0,0,0,,Mysterious tools?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.54,0:11:19.38,Main,,0,0,0,,A sword that can cut\Nan unlimited number of times,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.38,0:11:23.17,Main,,0,0,0,,guns that can shoot hundreds of bullets,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.17,0:11:26.46,Main,,0,0,0,,matches that show visions of mythical beasts...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.46,0:11:29.50,Main,,0,0,0,,They're mysterious objects that\Ncan draw out the user's special powers
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.50,0:11:34.79,Main,,0,0,0,,to make them as strong as,\Nor even stronger than mages.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.79,0:11:36.46,Main,,0,0,0,,Tools like that exist?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.46,0:11:40.79,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes. They are able to use\Ntools like that skillfully,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.79,0:11:46.21,Main,,0,0,0,,leading mages around by the nose\Nand then escaping successfully every time.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.21,0:11:51.33,Main,,0,0,0,,In this town, no one trusts that\Nmages can do anything anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.63,0:12:00.46,Main,,0,0,0,,Very well. I promise that\Nthis will be taken care of.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.46,0:12:02.58,Main,,0,0,0,,Thank you very much!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.58,0:12:06.21,Main,,0,0,0,,If such a refined witch as yourself\Ngets involved, then those guys--
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.21,0:12:07.58,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.58,0:12:10.21,Main,,0,0,0,,Not by me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.21,0:12:12.08,Main,,0,0,0,,By these two. Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.08,0:12:13.58,Main,,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.58,0:12:16.88,Main,,0,0,0,,Catch those Curio Company guys together.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.88,0:12:19.25,Main,,0,0,0,,Even if they have some annoying tools,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.25,0:12:24.29,Main,,0,0,0,,that shouldn't be a problem\Nfor my apprentices, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.29,0:12:26.17,Main,,0,0,0,,If you mess up,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.17,0:12:27.54,Main,,0,0,0,,you'll be expelled.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.54,0:12:29.54,Main,,0,0,0,,Expelled...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.54,0:12:34.88,Main,,0,0,0,,I think we were both thinking\Nthe same thing back then.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.88,0:12:40.67,Main,,0,0,0,,"I'll catch the Curio Company\Nmyself and get {\i1}her {\i0}expelled."
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.96,0:12:48.21,Main,,0,0,0,,W-Wait! Please, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.21,0:12:51.67,Main,,0,0,0,,Sorry! It was my fault! Just spare my life--
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.42,0:12:55.25,Main,,0,0,0,,I won't take your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.25,0:12:58.92,Main,,0,0,0,,All I want is that tool you have.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.92,0:13:00.29,Main,,0,0,0,,The sword?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.29,0:13:03.42,Main,,0,0,0,,Fine. You can have this sword!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.58,0:13:08.88,Main,,0,0,0,,And, I also have some questions--
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.88,0:13:11.29,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.29,0:13:14.29,Main,,0,0,0,,I saw him first.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.29,0:13:16.63,Main,,0,0,0,,He's my prey.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.63,0:13:19.08,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm the one who cornered this man.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.08,0:13:22.88,Main,,0,0,0,,No, I used you to corner him.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.88,0:13:26.46,Main,,0,0,0,,In other words, I'm ranked\Nhigher than you. Get it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.46,0:13:29.42,Main,,0,0,0,,No, and even if I did,\NI wouldn't hand him over to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.42,0:13:31.08,Main,,0,0,0,,--Huh?!\N--Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.75,0:13:39.17,Main,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?\NAre you trying to get in my way?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.17,0:13:41.83,Main,,0,0,0,,Or do you want our teacher to recognize you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.83,0:13:44.96,Main,,0,0,0,,Shut up. It has nothing to do with you!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.29,0:13:53.96,Main,,0,0,0,,In this way, we just kept sabotaging each other…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.21,0:13:59.50,Main,,0,0,0,,--In the end, days passed,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.50,0:14:00.33,Main,,0,0,0,,--Thanks for waiting.\N--In the end, days passed,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.33,0:14:01.46,Main,,0,0,0,,--Thanks for waiting.\N--and we were unable to catch\Nanyone from the Curio Company.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.46,0:14:02.88,Main,,0,0,0,,--Thanks.\N--and we were unable to catch\Nanyone from the Curio Company.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.88,0:14:05.33,Main,,0,0,0,,--and we were unable to catch\Nanyone from the Curio Company.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.25,0:14:14.29,Main,,0,0,0,,You're the witch called Fran, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.29,0:14:16.00,Main,,0,0,0,,Where did you learn my name?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.00,0:14:21.21,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about the details.\NMore importantly, is your work going well?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.21,0:14:24.13,Main,,0,0,0,,Does it look like it is?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.13,0:14:31.92,Main,,0,0,0,,Hm… "Curio Company leader declares\Nbeheading of mages attacking comrades."
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.13,0:14:37.17,Main,,0,0,0,,Looks like we're living in violent times.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.17,0:14:40.25,Main,,0,0,0,,No, this is exactly what I wanted.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.25,0:14:43.96,Main,,0,0,0,,Why? They want to kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.96,0:14:48.21,Main,,0,0,0,,Which means {\i1}they'll {\i0}come find {\i1}me{\i0}, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.21,0:14:50.79,Main,,0,0,0,,It saves me the trouble of finding them.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.79,0:14:54.33,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh? You seem very confident.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.33,0:14:59.67,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes. I mean, you actually {\i1}have {\i0}come.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.13,0:15:03.88,Main,,0,0,0,,Are you the leader of the Curio Company?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.13,0:15:26.04,Main,,0,0,0,,Oops, don't think you're\Ngoing to resist or anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.04,0:15:29.17,Main,,0,0,0,,If you make any weird moves,\NI'll cut off your head right here,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.17,0:15:32.54,Main,,0,0,0,,just like the newspaper headline said.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.42,0:15:40.08,Main,,0,0,0,,Take her away. We're going to dispose of her!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.08,0:15:41.17,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes'm!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.25,0:16:00.08,Main,,0,0,0,,What the heck? Don't get caught so easily.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.08,0:16:01.71,Main,,0,0,0,,You're a useless senior apprentice.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.71,0:16:04.29,Main,,0,0,0,,So you were caught, as well?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.29,0:16:08.21,Main,,0,0,0,,You are a completely useless junior apprentice.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.21,0:16:11.29,Main,,0,0,0,,You mages are always like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.29,0:16:15.54,Main,,0,0,0,,Getting in the way of our work all the time!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.54,0:16:21.29,Main,,0,0,0,,Thanks to you, we keep failing at our jobs!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.29,0:16:24.17,Main,,0,0,0,,I can't take it. I really can't take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.17,0:16:25.83,Main,,0,0,0,,And you lot!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.83,0:16:30.04,Main,,0,0,0,,To be bested by a couple of\Nlittle apprentice witches like this...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.04,0:16:32.92,Main,,0,0,0,,We finally got people\Nto lose confidence in mages,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.92,0:16:35.96,Main,,0,0,0,,and now you've let people trust in them again.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.96,0:16:39.13,Main,,0,0,0,,Are you trying to make all our work go to waste?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.13,0:16:42.46,Main,,0,0,0,,How can you call yourselves part\Nof the Curio Company like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.46,0:16:44.13,Main,,0,0,0,,Get your heads back in the game!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.13,0:16:45.29,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes'm!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.92,0:16:57.38,Main,,0,0,0,,We could hear everything you were\Ntalking about earlier, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.38,0:17:02.29,Main,,0,0,0,,What, is getting in our way\Nlike playtime for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.29,0:17:04.08,Main,,0,0,0,,Just beating the crap out of you guys
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.08,0:17:07.33,Main,,0,0,0,,can't even be called playtime.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.33,0:17:08.71,Main,,0,0,0,,Y-You little--
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.58,0:17:13.83,Main,,0,0,0,,Boss!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.83,0:17:16.58,Main,,0,0,0,,Dispose of them now! Immediately!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.58,0:17:17.71,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes'm!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.58,0:17:57.88,Main,,0,0,0,,Take that!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.38,0:18:01.88,Main,,0,0,0,,B-Boss!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.88,0:18:03.13,Main,,0,0,0,,You little--
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.71,0:18:12.25,Main,,0,0,0,,Wh-What are you doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.25,0:18:14.54,Main,,0,0,0,,Hurry up and kill them!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.54,0:18:15.67,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes'm!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.92,0:18:45.29,Main,,0,0,0,,Could it be that you got yourself\Ncaught on purpose, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.71,0:18:51.17,Main,,0,0,0,,I thought I'd sneak in and\Nround them all up at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.17,0:18:52.75,Main,,0,0,0,,It's reckless.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.96,0:18:55.63,Main,,0,0,0,,The same goes for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.33,0:19:13.21,Main,,0,0,0,,As expected of you honorable mages.\NWe're still unable to--
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.79,0:19:22.96,Main,,0,0,0,,Shall we rest a bit before\Nwe contact the association?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.96,0:19:24.71,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah, let's.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.17,0:19:34.67,Main,,0,0,0,,Why do you want to study magic from our teacher?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.67,0:19:37.79,Main,,0,0,0,,The reason's not that interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.46,0:19:41.96,Main,,0,0,0,,I learned magic on my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.96,0:19:44.63,Main,,0,0,0,,Huh? H-Hey! Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.33,0:19:50.04,Main,,0,0,0,,I used that to get by,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.04,0:19:53.75,Main,,0,0,0,,but one day, the person\NI tried to steal from was Teach.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.75,0:19:57.13,Main,,0,0,0,,She caught me easily.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.13,0:20:03.08,Main,,0,0,0,,That was the first time I heard about witches.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.08,0:20:05.79,Main,,0,0,0,,You didn't know about witches until then?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.50,0:20:10.71,Main,,0,0,0,,Well, no one told me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.71,0:20:13.25,Main,,0,0,0,,But Teach told me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.25,0:20:15.25,Main,,0,0,0,,She told me about how strong witches are,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.25,0:20:18.17,Main,,0,0,0,,and how much people respect them.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.17,0:20:23.54,Main,,0,0,0,,I thought that I could stop living\Nlike a stray cat if I became a witch.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.54,0:20:26.38,Main,,0,0,0,,That's why I asked her\Nto make me her apprentice.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.38,0:20:30.63,Main,,0,0,0,,See? It's not that interesting, is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.63,0:20:33.71,Main,,0,0,0,,Well, what about you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.71,0:20:37.88,Main,,0,0,0,,My reason's much less interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.88,0:20:41.13,Main,,0,0,0,,There are no witches where I'm from.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.13,0:20:45.88,Main,,0,0,0,,So, if I become a witch,\Nthen I'll be the only one in the country.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.88,0:20:49.67,Main,,0,0,0,,Then I'd always have a way\Nto make a living, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.67,0:20:51.04,Main,,0,0,0,,That's why.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.96,0:20:56.58,Main,,0,0,0,,So you're becoming a witch\Nfor your own self-interest.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.58,0:20:58.83,Main,,0,0,0,,To summarize, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.50,0:21:03.13,Main,,0,0,0,,What the heck? It's the same as me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.13,0:21:04.46,Main,,0,0,0,,I suppose so.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.50,0:21:12.96,Main,,0,0,0,,Sheila and I rounded up all\Nthe members of Curio Company.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.96,0:21:18.79,Main,,0,0,0,,Damn it! I'll get you back for this!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.63,0:21:24.04,Main,,0,0,0,,Won't they try something\Nagain once they get out?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.04,0:21:25.54,Main,,0,0,0,,Maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.92,0:21:31.08,Main,,0,0,0,,You two--you really did a good job.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.08,0:21:35.58,Main,,0,0,0,,After that, we continued\Nto travel with our teacher
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.58,0:21:38.38,Main,,0,0,0,,and when she returned to her own country--
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.21,0:21:44.46,Main,,0,0,0,,All right, finally!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.46,0:21:46.33,Main,,0,0,0,,Thank you very much!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.33,0:21:48.04,Main,,0,0,0,,They look good on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.04,0:21:51.17,Main,,0,0,0,,And now, you two are officially witches.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.17,0:21:52.42,Main,,0,0,0,,--Yes, ma'am!\N--Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.42,0:21:55.63,Main,,0,0,0,,Also, for your witch titles--
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.21,0:21:59.58,Main,,0,0,0,,Fran's hair is black, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.58,0:22:01.88,Main,,0,0,0,,So she'll be the Stardust Witch.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.88,0:22:03.04,Main,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.04,0:22:05.71,Main,,0,0,0,,And Sheila's hair is shiny, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.71,0:22:07.83,Main,,0,0,0,,So she'll be the Night Witch.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.83,0:22:08.96,Main,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.96,0:22:12.21,Main,,0,0,0,,Shouldn't I be the Night Witch,\Nsince my hair is black?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.21,0:22:16.08,Main,,0,0,0,,And if my hair's shiny,\Nshouldn't I be the Stardust Witch?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.08,0:22:17.38,Main,,0,0,0,,The night...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.38,0:22:18.67,Main,,0,0,0,,...and stardust...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.67,0:22:21.21,Main,,0,0,0,,...set each other off so each looks its best.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.63,0:22:25.29,Main,,0,0,0,,I don't really understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.21,0:22:35.71,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh! Are you trying to say\Nthat even though we're apart,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.71,0:22:38.63,Main,,0,0,0,,we'll still be together?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.58,0:22:45.21,Main,,0,0,0,,It looks like you were right.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.21,0:22:49.25,Main,,0,0,0,,But why did you base\Nour names on our hair color?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.25,0:22:51.25,Main,,0,0,0,,Because it's cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.25,0:22:54.38,Main,,0,0,0,,And so, our journey with our teacher ended.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.38,0:22:57.71,Main,,0,0,0,,I returned to my homeland and became a teacher,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.71,0:23:03.25,Main,,0,0,0,,and Sheila unexpectedly ended up\Nworking for the United Magic Association.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.25,0:23:05.33,Main,,0,0,0,,You've really changed, haven't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.33,0:23:06.83,Main,,0,0,0,,Not really.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.83,0:23:11.42,Main,,0,0,0,,But anyway, I like our relationship now\Nbetter than when all we did was fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.42,0:23:12.92,Main,,0,0,0,,It's easier.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.92,0:23:15.54,Main,,0,0,0,,You really {\i1}have {\i0}changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.54,0:23:18.58,Main,,0,0,0,,We've just both grown up.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.58,0:23:20.33,Main,,0,0,0,,Come on, the sun's about to set.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.33,0:23:21.38,Main,,0,0,0,,Let's hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.38,0:23:22.46,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.79,0:23:29.71,Main,,0,0,0,,That small box...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.71,0:23:31.83,Main,,0,0,0,,That's--
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.83,0:23:33.58,Main,,0,0,0,,Change of plan!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.58,0:23:35.33,Main,,0,0,0,,Wait, what's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.33,0:23:37.50,Main,,0,0,0,,Just follow me!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.50,0:23:41.38,Main,,0,0,0,,Jeez, you're inconsiderate, as usual.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.38,0:23:43.04,Main,,0,0,0,,Please wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.63,0:23:51.75,Main,,0,0,0,,That day, I was headed toward a certain town--
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.75,0:23:56.50,Main,,0,0,0,,It was the town where, in volume four of\Nmy favorite book, {\i1}The Adventures of Niké{\i0},
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.50,0:24:01.04,Main,,0,0,0,,the friendship of Niké's two apprentices,\NFoula and Shiren, budded--
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.04,0:24:02.92,Main,,0,0,0,,A sacred place for Niké fans.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.92,0:24:06.50,Main,,0,0,0,,That's right, it's Qunorts, the Town of Freedom.
